${ocrText}

Respond with ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:
{
  "status": "green" | "amber" | "red",
  "reason": "string",
  "nextStep": "string"
}

- "green": Document is fully compliant, no action needed
- "amber": Document has minor issues or requires review
